    <summary>PS4 reverse-engineering workbench with live debugging, scanning and a decompiler.</summary>
    <description>SlopStation is a Windows workbench for PS4 reverse engineering and game research: live memory, value scanning with a freeze watchlist, software breakpoints and hardware watchpoints, ELF/PE/Mach-O static analysis with a decompiler and an x86-64 emulator, Xray obfuscation passes, patching with a journal, Lua scripting and an MCP server for AI agents.

The bundled installer is per-user (NSIS currentUser): it installs for the account running Chocolatey, not for every user on the machine. Use SlopStation only on consoles, games and systems you own or are authorized to test.</description>
